WEBVTT

00:10:28.082 --> 00:10:30.417
I'm talking about finding ways
to break the rules

00:10:30.459 --> 00:10:31.752
of responsible adulthood,

00:10:31.752 --> 00:10:35.547
and giving yourself permission
to get a kick out of your own life.

00:10:36.131 --> 00:10:37.591
One person told me

00:10:37.591 --> 00:10:40.094
that some of the most fun
she'd had in recent memory,

00:10:40.135 --> 00:10:41.553
happened on a Friday morning,

00:10:41.553 --> 00:10:43.972
when she and some of her friends
ditched their work

00:10:43.972 --> 00:10:45.808
and their childcare responsibilities,

00:10:45.849 --> 00:10:47.685
tucked flasks into their purses

00:10:47.726 --> 00:10:52.523
and snuck out to a 10:30am showing
of the movie "Bad Moms."

00:10:52.523 --> 00:10:56.527
(Laughter)

00:10:56.527 --> 00:10:59.196
So lastly, here's one more thing
that you can do today

00:10:59.238 --> 00:11:01.073
to start having more fun.